Error [jet.BindingTypeMismatch]: This needs U8, but the value is Int
  --> tests/ui/number_name_write_conflict.jet:8:18
    |
  8 |     count = line.len()
    |                  ^^^
  --> tests/ui/number_name_write_conflict.jet:7:17
